; Power and speed test: 5 x 5 squares of 8 mm
; generated by Maker Connect example generator
; GRBL 1.1 laser, laser mode on ($32=1), power range S0-1000 ($30=1000).
; Positions are absolute, in mm, from the machine origin after homing ($H).
; Try it on scrap cardboard or plywood, wear the goggles, stay at the machine.
; Columns, left to right: 10, 20, 30, 40, 50 % power.
; Rows, front to back: 600, 1200, 1800, 2400, 3000 mm/min.
; Covers X10 to X58, Y10 to Y58. Fill: lines 0.25 mm apart.
; estimated printing time (normal mode) = 5m 47s
G21 ; millimetres
G90 ; absolute
M5 ; laser off
M4 S0 ; dynamic power, off while not moving
